Deprecated: IsotropicRefinementChoice and the functions which use it
(CellAccessor::refine_choice(), CellAccessor::set_refine_choice(),
CellAccessor::clear_refine_choice(),
ReferenceCell::get_isotropic_refinement_choice(), and
ReferenceCell::n_isotropic_refinement_choices()) are deprecated: use
RefinementChoice (e.g., RefinementChoices::Cut49) with
CellAccessor::refinement_choice_set() and CellAccessor::set_refine_flag()
instead. Since the refinement choice of a tetrahedron is now part of its
refinement flag, CellAccessor::set_refine_choice() now also flags the cell for
refinement.
<br>
